WEBVTT

01:06:27.528 --> 01:06:30.830
DB: There's a level of love and care
that is just completely human,

01:06:30.854 --> 01:06:34.645
and in that level of love and care,
that's where our dignity is found.

01:06:34.669 --> 01:06:36.131
CA: That's a beautiful line.

01:06:36.733 --> 01:06:39.504
Well, David Brooks, this has been
an amazing conversation.

01:06:39.528 --> 01:06:44.976
We have charted individual dreams
and the fate of the country,

01:06:45.000 --> 01:06:46.351
the planet, etc.

01:06:46.375 --> 01:06:47.779
I've loved every minute.

01:06:47.803 --> 01:06:51.289
DB: Thank you. It's been a great honor
to be here. Thank you, Chris.

01:06:51.313 --> 01:06:53.313
(Music)

01:06:57.753 --> 01:07:00.179
CA: David Brooks
is a "New York Times" columnist